    "atom::3e9b4c255e7f49de211bb37f": {
      "atom_id": "atom::3e9b4c255e7f49de211bb37f",
      "source_handle": "P0273",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "尽管免疫疗法提高了部分晚期癌症患者的生存率，但仅少数患者受益且常伴随严重免疫相关不良事件（irAEs）。目前尚缺乏基于临床证据的指导方针来利用肠道微生物组预测治疗反应或管理副作用。本研究试图厘清肠道微生物组作为预测生物标志物的潜力及其在增强疗效和减少副作用中的作用。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::2694ad4ea52a0088aba17fec8749475852bf5ca9f787b90de4f0629fb7feefb5",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::eb554c2581ab757501df96e5e2c1e4a52b3957dd1999e4e6739aad243fb42bcb",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::17ec529e254380cf6b84cb8828d0e4b7cbcb40aeb149c1edacb6805d9c2bdaff",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::a3268446eeccae7db7d8c8dc8357200d17f5878384feca5bebb88454e33ef061",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::da974f2fb7161247d30ad326": {
      "atom_id": "atom::da974f2fb7161247d30ad326",
      "source_handle": "P0273",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "临床癌症患者（晚期转移性黑色素瘤、肝细胞癌、非小细胞肺癌及肾细胞癌），聚焦于免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs）治疗前后的肠道微生物组特征及其与疗效和不良事件的关系。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::2694ad4ea52a0088aba17fec8749475852bf5ca9f787b90de4f0629fb7feefb5",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::eb554c2581ab757501df96e5e2c1e4a52b3957dd1999e4e6739aad243fb42bcb",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::17ec529e254380cf6b84cb8828d0e4b7cbcb40aeb149c1edacb6805d9c2bdaff",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::a661682498bda1f84315fff9d52b911641eea4f263936833a0e4427d7f3df9d0",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::39e920e15e0d4141f1858275": {
      "atom_id": "atom::39e920e15e0d4141f1858275",
      "source_handle": "P0273",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该综述旨在评估肠道微生物组对癌症患者免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs）临床结局及相关不良事件（AEs）的影响。作者检索了截至2021年3月的PubMed、Medline和ScienceDirect数据库，筛选出10项涉及成年人的临床研究。研究综合分析了基线微生物组的多样性（α/β多样性）和组成成分与ICIs疗效（无进展生存期PFS、总生存期OS）及胃肠道毒性（如结肠炎）之间的关联，并探讨了粪菌移植（FMT）在难治性患者中的潜在调节作用。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::2694ad4ea52a0088aba17fec8749475852bf5ca9f787b90de4f0629fb7feefb5",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::eb554c2581ab757501df96e5e2c1e4a52b3957dd1999e4e6739aad243fb42bcb",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::17ec529e254380cf6b84cb8828d0e4b7cbcb40aeb149c1edacb6805d9c2bdaff",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::887a8566a1ee5096997553b58b9791c94b3bf24e443221cb6922579a5f2f213b",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::e12c726d38ae415b29a4492d": {
      "atom_id": "atom::e12c726d38ae415b29a4492d",
      "source_handle": "P0273",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该论文提供了关于肠道微生物组如何影响实体瘤免疫治疗疗效的临床证据汇总，特别指出了特定菌群（如Faecalibacterium, Akkermansia）与疗效的正向关联，以及抗生素使用或特定菌群缺失与疗效不佳或毒性的关联。此外，它提供了FMT作为克服免疫耐药的临床干预案例，是讨论微生物组调控机制和临床转化潜力的重要素材。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::2694ad4ea52a0088aba17fec8749475852bf5ca9f787b90de4f0629fb7feefb5",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::eb554c2581ab757501df96e5e2c1e4a52b3957dd1999e4e6739aad243fb42bcb",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::17ec529e254380cf6b84cb8828d0e4b7cbcb40aeb149c1edacb6805d9c2bdaff",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::f89dd5ece4dd44bb061003b45f97ddecdfbcd34e3f5ae786394e1b7d37dbb2c7",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::0539b1b2c53b3d7b72cb824c": {
      "atom_id": "atom::0539b1b2c53b3d7b72cb824c",
      "source_handle": "P0273",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "这些关联主要基于观察性研究，存在癌症类型异质性和样本量小的限制，不能直接推断因果机制。不同研究中具体差异菌种存在不一致性。",
        "contribution": "提供了多项临床研究数据，表明基线肠道微生物组的特定组成（如Faecalibacterium prausnitzii, Bifidobacterium longum, Akkermansia muciniphila的高丰度）和较高多样性与ICIs治疗的良好临床响应（延长PFS/OS）相关。同时指出Bacteroidales的高丰度与非响应相关。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::2694ad4ea52a0088aba17fec8749475852bf5ca9f787b90de4f0629fb7feefb5",
