    "atom::db7a8435ac609db0d12fd3fc": {
      "atom_id": "atom::db7a8435ac609db0d12fd3fc",
      "source_handle": "P0417",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "approach"
      ],
      "value": "遵循PRISMA指南进行系统综述。在Medline数据库中搜索“cancer immunotherapy”或“immune checkpoint inhibitors”与“microbiome”、“probiotic”、“antibiotic”、“dysbiosis”的组合词。纳入标准为英语或法语出版物，描述可量化的微生物组组成/修饰与ICI反应或irAEs之间的联系。排除综述、评论和专家意见（但筛查其参考文献）。数据提取变量包括患者数量、ICI类型、癌症类型、微生物组评估方法、干预措施及量化效应。未进行定量合成（Meta分析），而是进行定性综合。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::c1380d633739b6409c09a4c3ee78ec05f17624561fe7d5fe1dd336699e226c44",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "approach"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::5b707a9c2a4912437225849fe19dbd25efd93ce5e0d74a9b7e06be3bfe21b244",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "approach"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::1fd227bf27d6d15554f9ced9bb8d6b3fb34d9cfe28b6ead92bf02a96743e96a1",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "approach"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::b23ff4583f66840bde820fe4d249e9838824eb44345c14da6c0d85bf5a3d6b26",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::a372f35d37fbc9e9ab705838": {
      "atom_id": "atom::a372f35d37fbc9e9ab705838",
      "source_handle": "P0417",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "contribution_and_limits"
      ],
      "value": {
        "contribution": "提供了截至2018年底关于肠道微生物组如何影响ICI疗效和毒性的临床证据的综合视图。确认了抗生素使用的负面影响，并指出了特定微生物特征（如多样性、特定菌属比例）与疗效的潜在联系。",
        "limits": "仅检索Medline数据库，可能遗漏其他来源的研究。纳入的研究多为回顾性、样本量小且异质性高，缺乏前瞻性试验数据。未能确定具体的因果机制，且无法精确定义抗生素暴露的最佳时间窗口或优先避免的抗生素类别。所给摘要未交代具体的统计学检验细节及偏倚风险评估过程。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::c1380d633739b6409c09a4c3ee78ec05f17624561fe7d5fe1dd336699e226c44",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "0"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::5b707a9c2a4912437225849fe19dbd25efd93ce5e0d74a9b7e06be3bfe21b244",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "0"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::1fd227bf27d6d15554f9ced9bb8d6b3fb34d9cfe28b6ead92bf02a96743e96a1",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::2b464d3f5eff6a7f286be8d1dfff26089f00bef3312f677c9ebe94ffec03f482",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::b3fb5721262e723c91289978": {
      "atom_id": "atom::b3fb5721262e723c91289978",
      "source_handle": "P0417",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "实体瘤患者（NSCLC, RCC为主），接受ICI治疗前后使用抗生素（ABt组 vs ABn组）",
        "finding": "抗生素使用与较低的ICI疗效相关。在RCC患者中，抗生素显著缩短PFS和OS，降低ORR；在NSCLC患者中，抗生素显著降低OS，但对PFS和ORR的影响不一致或无显著差异。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::c1380d633739b6409c09a4c3ee78ec05f17624561fe7d5fe1dd336699e226c44",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "0"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::5b707a9c2a4912437225849fe19dbd25efd93ce5e0d74a9b7e06be3bfe21b244",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "0"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::1fd227bf27d6d15554f9ced9bb8d6b3fb34d9cfe28b6ead92bf02a96743e96a1",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::75c9ca2e92e0baa8ac9178335f491ca897a380088a4a191eb008db235d7a7476",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::67cace238a913bff89cc5bbd": {
      "atom_id": "atom::67cace238a913bff89cc5bbd",
      "source_handle": "P0417",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "不同癌症类型（黑色素瘤、NSCLC、RCC、SCCHN），基线粪便或唾液样本",
        "finding": "微生物组组成与ICI疗效存在显著关联，但具体细菌物种在不同研究中不一致（如Bifidobacterium longum, Akkermansia muciniphila, Ruminococcaceae等）。高细菌多样性和“响应者相关”细菌与“非响应者相关”细菌的良好比例似乎与更好的患者预后相关。口腔微生物组与ICI疗效无明显关联。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::c1380d633739b6409c09a4c3ee78ec05f17624561fe7d5fe1dd336699e226c44",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::5b707a9c2a4912437225849fe19dbd25efd93ce5e0d74a9b7e06be3bfe21b244",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::1fd227bf27d6d15554f9ced9bb8d6b3fb34d9cfe28b6ead92bf02a96743e96a1",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::75c9ca2e92e0baa8ac9178335f491ca897a380088a4a191eb008db235d7a7476",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::636297537a64ff7d48ea6f38": {
      "atom_id": "atom::636297537a64ff7d48ea6f38",
      "source_handle": "P0417",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "黑色素瘤患者，接受Ipilimumab治疗",
        "finding": "微生物组组成与irAEs（特别是结肠炎）的发生相关。某些细菌（如Faecalibacterium prausnitzii）的高丰度与结肠炎风险增加相关，而其他细菌（如Bacteroidetes）的高丰度则与低发生率相关。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::c1380d633739b6409c09a4c3ee78ec05f17624561fe7d5fe1dd336699e226c44",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
