        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "尽管前体模型显示肠道微生物组显著影响ICI疗效，但在临床实践中这种相互作用尚不清楚。本研究试图确定：(1)抗生素是否影响ICI疗效；(2)基线微生物组组成是否与ICI疗效相关；(3)基线微生物组组成是否与irAEs发生相关；(4)微生物组操纵是否能减轻irAEs。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::c1380d633739b6409c09a4c3ee78ec05f17624561fe7d5fe1dd336699e226c44",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::5b707a9c2a4912437225849fe19dbd25efd93ce5e0d74a9b7e06be3bfe21b244",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::1fd227bf27d6d15554f9ced9bb8d6b3fb34d9cfe28b6ead92bf02a96743e96a1",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::72721e83229bc55518c93ff91abdb4ce20b91dddf4e191bcfc135c9674ab8651",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::36d86217c97658464f951139": {
      "atom_id": "atom::36d86217c97658464f951139",
      "source_handle": "P0417",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "人类实体瘤患者（主要为非小细胞肺癌、肾细胞癌、黑色素瘤等）接受免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs，包括抗CTLA-4、抗PD-1和抗PD-L1抗体）治疗期间，肠道微生物组（GM）及其修饰（如抗生素使用、粪便微生物群移植FMT）对ICI疗效及免疫相关不良事件（irAEs）的影响。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::c1380d633739b6409c09a4c3ee78ec05f17624561fe7d5fe1dd336699e226c44",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::5b707a9c2a4912437225849fe19dbd25efd93ce5e0d74a9b7e06be3bfe21b244",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::1fd227bf27d6d15554f9ced9bb8d6b3fb34d9cfe28b6ead92bf02a96743e96a1",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::5e61b77163843c33f493df86e55717306bc17e766fa4ca9b0fc840e284bd3c7e",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::43d061a73b3a3eae2757344b": {
      "atom_id": "atom::43d061a73b3a3eae2757344b",
      "source_handle": "P0417",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "这是一篇2019年发表的系统综述，旨在评估临床实践中肠道微生物组与免疫检查点抑制剂疗效之间的关联。作者通过Medline检索，筛选出13项符合纳入标准的人类研究（包括全文文章和摘要），分别分析了抗生素使用对ICI疗效的影响、基线微生物组组成与ICI疗效的相关性、以及微生物组组成与irAEs（特别是结肠炎）的相关性。研究发现抗生素使用普遍与ICI疗效降低相关，而特定的微生物组成或多样性与更好的临床结局有关；此外，FMT在个别案例中显示出缓解ICI诱导的结肠炎的潜力。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::c1380d633739b6409c09a4c3ee78ec05f17624561fe7d5fe1dd336699e226c44",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::5b707a9c2a4912437225849fe19dbd25efd93ce5e0d74a9b7e06be3bfe21b244",
          "field_path": [
