        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "用于回答“介导该效应的机制是什么”这一子问题。虽然这是作者基于文献的推测而非本研究的直接实验验证，但它提供了将观察到的微生物组变化与已知免疫学机制联系起来的理论框架。可用于综述中讨论微生物组影响免疫治疗的潜在生物学通路（如DC成熟、T细胞浸润、炎症调控）。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a7b91a87db840b7e201226a99d95e7e47325cdc2ba8b568e02bb8144657844d6",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::d3d3338725bcb6af1d221f0aae9f1b361312ce703fcf11ad2cb0262219fa4fe8",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::fe5c600d9bf2b28e4f9f43203610a19132867cde5f76806ca84387d3caacfa8c",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::3eff9b0b0de1ad40b8bb9a640591f2e7592427fa63f75618ba8eead20c3e684e",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::33c36586a7db5a915e06910a": {
      "atom_id": "atom::33c36586a7db5a915e06910a",
      "source_handle": "P0271",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该研究提供了关于肠道微生物组如何关联固体肿瘤（NSCLC）免疫治疗疗效的直接观察数据。其核心价值在于指出了特定细菌属（有益菌与有害菌）与临床预后（TTF）的方向性关联，尽管由于样本量限制，部分关联未达到统计学显著性。对于综述而言，它提供了具体的“菌-效应”对应关系素材，特别是关于Bilophila与较差预后的负向关联，以及Lactobacillus/Clostridium的正向趋势，可用于支持或反驳不同研究中微生物组对ICI疗效影响的异质性。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a7b91a87db840b7e201226a99d95e7e47325cdc2ba8b568e02bb8144657844d6",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::d3d3338725bcb6af1d221f0aae9f1b361312ce703fcf11ad2cb0262219fa4fe8",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::fe5c600d9bf2b28e4f9f43203610a19132867cde5f76806ca84387d3caacfa8c",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::13a514a4d477511b344aa9e14c3e44643538a84f8efcede4abe4f60efd096021",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::9d72b6e0010b3d3164b7d7c6": {
      "atom_id": "atom::9d72b6e0010b3d3164b7d7c6",
      "source_handle": "P0271",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "该研究样本量极小（17例），统计效力不足，许多具有生物学意义的趋势（如Lactobacillus）未达到统计学显著性。解读时应避免夸大其确定性，应视为探索性证据。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a7b91a87db840b7e201226a99d95e7e47325cdc2ba8b568e02bb8144657844d6",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "0"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::d3d3338725bcb6af1d221f0aae9f1b361312ce703fcf11ad2cb0262219fa4fe8",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "0"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::fe5c600d9bf2b28e4f9f43203610a19132867cde5f76806ca84387d3caacfa8c",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::17f81b98ae53efaee50f796f1f1cdfc61fa186fc49699e99b776b5232ac4fa8a",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::074cdfbcfd322f6d67a049c2": {
      "atom_id": "atom::074cdfbcfd322f6d67a049c2",
      "source_handle": "P0271",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "研究对象仅限于日本NSCLC患者，且均为长期治疗者（>3个月），存在严重的选择偏倚（幸存者偏差）。结果可能不适用于早期治疗失败者或其他种族群体。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a7b91a87db840b7e201226a99d95e7e47325cdc2ba8b568e02bb8144657844d6",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::d3d3338725bcb6af1d221f0aae9f1b361312ce703fcf11ad2cb0262219fa4fe8",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::fe5c600d9bf2b28e4f9f43203610a19132867cde5f76806ca84387d3caacfa8c",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::17f81b98ae53efaee50f796f1f1cdfc61fa186fc49699e99b776b5232ac4fa8a",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::f7623f6dc731e0c0283e2dad": {
      "atom_id": "atom::f7623f6dc731e0c0283e2dad",
      "source_handle": "P0271",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "作者提出的机制（如Lactobacillus促进DC成熟）是基于文献综述的推测，本研究并未提供直接的分子或细胞水平证据。在综述中引用时，必须明确区分这是作者的假设还是本研究的实证结果。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a7b91a87db840b7e201226a99d95e7e47325cdc2ba8b568e02bb8144657844d6",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "2"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::d3d3338725bcb6af1d221f0aae9f1b361312ce703fcf11ad2cb0262219fa4fe8",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "2"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::fe5c600d9bf2b28e4f9f43203610a19132867cde5f76806ca84387d3caacfa8c",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "2"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::17f81b98ae53efaee50f796f1f1cdfc61fa186fc49699e99b776b5232ac4fa8a",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::243b8b14a4b69c54d5bf5f1c": {
      "atom_id": "atom::243b8b14a4b69c54d5bf5f1c",
      "source_handle": "P0271",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "Bilophila高丰度与延长TTF（更好疗效）的关联可能与部分其他研究报道的负面作用相反，这突显了微生物组研究的高度情境依赖性和潜在矛盾，需谨慎对待单一研究的结论。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a7b91a87db840b7e201226a99d95e7e47325cdc2ba8b568e02bb8144657844d6",
          "field_path": [
