    "atom::3fb7c28aa6d5a8423ece0135": {
      "atom_id": "atom::3fb7c28aa6d5a8423ece0135",
      "source_handle": "P0578",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "针对晚期实体瘤（黑色素瘤、头颈部鳞癌、肾细胞癌、微卫星不稳定性高胰腺癌）中免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）耐药或进展的患者，评估来自ICI长期响应者的粪菌移植（FMT）联合ICI治疗的安全性和有效性。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e922ecd2e5e9a27ad505756ecac7aefe8d3f347156a4dddb6acdd9f32d90d99b",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::de6856b325f938438220cbe8b17903dd941239ef440c8510463fecefd670962a",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::2796f4a95907dc27585d9be6c34717031ccbf68aa1205c3f86aa55982b202416",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::0917d4fda6afdc4254528e5db4bdbe9fb07733176e3e7f313147d8b4d8fe3cb4",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::b0ae5567370b869d8e867f54": {
      "atom_id": "atom::b0ae5567370b869d8e867f54",
      "source_handle": "P0578",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "本研究是一项单臂IIa期篮子试验（MITRIC），旨在验证通过FMT调节肠道微生物群能否克服已建立的ICI耐药性。研究纳入了12名在转移性阶段对ICI治疗进展的患者，使用ICI长期响应者作为供体，给予患者最多五次FMT（前两次通过结肠镜，后续通过灌肠），并继续原有ICI治疗。主要终点为FMT相关不良事件和客观缓解率（ORR）。结果显示FMT安全性良好，但未能观察到客观肿瘤反应（ORR为0%），仅5名患者达到疾病稳定。尽管缺乏总体疗效证据，研究发现FMT诱导了短暂的微生物定植，且外周血中的免疫细胞特征（如分化T细胞与髓系细胞的平衡）与生存期显著相关，但这些免疫特征似乎更多反映疾病本身状态而非FMT的特异性干预效果。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e922ecd2e5e9a27ad505756ecac7aefe8d3f347156a4dddb6acdd9f32d90d99b",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::de6856b325f938438220cbe8b17903dd941239ef440c8510463fecefd670962a",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::2796f4a95907dc27585d9be6c34717031ccbf68aa1205c3f86aa55982b202416",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::694f844b31a311b283ebcd8c330e565a713268dd3a3ef3566ee833f0805bd2b6",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::65afbda06643b302dd5578de": {
      "atom_id": "atom::65afbda06643b302dd5578de",
      "source_handle": "P0578",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该论文提供了关于FMT在ICI耐药实体瘤中应用的阴性疗效结果及详细的转化医学发现。对于综述而言，其核心价值在于反驳了“FMT能普遍逆转ICI耐药”的简单假设，并指出了患者选择（如疾病进展速度、既往免疫状态）和供体匹配的重要性。同时，它提供了关于肠道微生物定植持久性与临床获益之间潜在联系的生物学见解，以及系统性免疫景观（特别是髓系细胞和T细胞亚群）作为预后生物标志物的证据。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e922ecd2e5e9a27ad505756ecac7aefe8d3f347156a4dddb6acdd9f32d90d99b",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::de6856b325f938438220cbe8b17903dd941239ef440c8510463fecefd670962a",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::2796f4a95907dc27585d9be6c34717031ccbf68aa1205c3f86aa55982b202416",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::39c32e293e23c75b160ed67e70814f725025cf8863b11690c58d94dc1762281c",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::3fb862a9266fa81e78d243db": {
      "atom_id": "atom::3fb862a9266fa81e78d243db",
      "source_handle": "P0578",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "仅适用于ICI耐药/进展人群，不能外推至一线治疗场景。样本量极小，结果可能存在偶然性，但趋势明确。",
        "contribution": "提供了FMT在广泛ICI耐药实体瘤队列中的真实世界疗效数据：ORR为0%，中位PFS仅为1.5个月。这表明在非选择性、快速进展的耐药人群中，FMT联合ICI并非有效的挽救疗法。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e922ecd2e5e9a27ad505756ecac7aefe8d3f347156a4dddb6acdd9f32d90d99b",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::de6856b325f938438220cbe8b17903dd941239ef440c8510463fecefd670962a",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::2796f4a95907dc27585d9be6c34717031ccbf68aa1205c3f86aa55982b202416",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::e0dd85791a8ef650fb1e2518218069289d4e418cbea5c45f335b72481142cdac",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
